Subject: [PATCH] gtk4: keep Wayland backend enabled on iOS

The Darwin Meson branch force-disables Wayland. The iOS cross build supplies
the Wayland dependencies and needs the requested backend option to survive.

diff -ruN -U0 --exclude=*.bak a/meson.build b/meson.build
--- a/meson.build	2024-08-16 07:56:14
+++ b/meson.build	2026-07-04 23:41:40
@@ -125 +125 @@
-  wayland_enabled = false
+  wayland_enabled = wayland_enabled
@@ -132 +132 @@
-  wayland_enabled = false
+  wayland_enabled = wayland_enabled
